    ' ---- Begin Inlined Level 2: IFsEducSec_new_init:GradeWiseEnrollmentInit
' Private Sub GradeWiseEnrollmentInit(R%, gndr%, startcycle As Single, lencycle As Single, Intake As Single, ByRef GradeStudents(,,) As Single, AvgDropOutRate As Single, ByRef GradeDropOutRate() As Single, ByRef TotStudents As Single)
                '-----Education Module ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
