                    'caledseclowrgratevoc = caledseclowrgrategen * EDSECLOWRVOC(R%, gndr) / (100 - EDSECLOWRVOC(R%, gndr))
                    'mti 2014/03/27 - end
    
                    'EDSECLOWRGRATE(R%, gndr) = caledseclowrgrategen + caledseclowrgratevoc
                    EDSECLOWRGRADS(R%, gndr) = CSng(fagedst(CInt(secStart(R%) + edseclowrlen(R%)), R%, gndr) * (EDSECLOWRGRATE(R%, gndr) / 100))
    
                    'All Years but First: Lower Secondary Final: Total students and graduates for both genders
