                    caledsecint = EDSECLOWRENRGGRD(R%, CInt(edseclowrlen(R%)), gndr%) * EDSECUPPRTRAN(R%, gndr) / 100
                    'mti 2022/04/12 end

                    'First Year Upper Secondary: Dropout rate  ( assume (General) dropout evenly over the length (upto the final graduation))
