    ' ---- Begin Inlined Level 2: IFsEducSec_new_init:GenderParityCalc
' Private Sub GenderParityCalc(TargetYr As Single, ByRef RateMale As Single, ByRef RateFemale As Single, level$)
                'edseclowrgndreqgrad(R%) = edprigndreqintn(R%), ValInit=edprigndreqintnI(R%)
    
                If edseclowrgndreqgrad(R%) = 0 Then
