            '            EDEXPERPRI(R%%) = EDEXPERPRI(R%%) * sCostPerDelta(R%, Primary)
            '            iEDEXPERPRI(R%) = EDEXPERPRI(R%%)
            'mti 2018/06/18 End

            'Note: sCostPerDelta(R%, Primary) is the smoothed ratio of the final and the pre-budget costs-per-student; this is needed to check transient from budget impact
