            '            EDEXPERSECLOWR(R%%) = EDEXPERSECLOWR(R%%) * edexperseclowrm(R%%)
            '            EDEXPERSECLOWR(R%%) = EDEXPERSECLOWR(R%%) * sCostPerDelta(R%, SecLowr)
            '            iEDEXPERSECLOWR(R%) = EDEXPERSECLOWR(R%%)
            'mti 2018/06/18 End

            'See notes on sCostPerDelta(R%, SecLowr) and iEDEXPERSECLOWR(R%) in the primary-per-student-cost section above
