                    '            EDTERGRATE(R%, gndr) = IIf(edtergradgr(R%, gndr) <> 0, AMAX(gEdTerGrate(R%, gndr), EDTERGRATE(R%, gndr)), EDTERGRATE(R%, gndr))
    
    
                    'All Years but First: Tertiary Final: dropout rate
